 === CONTROL INPUT ===


 THIS IS A SPIN-UNRESTRICTED CALCULATION.
 THE 1ST CYCLE WILL BE A SEPARATED-ATOM CALCULATION.
 NO EWMO CALCULATION WILL BE PERFORMED - ONLY ATOMIC SCF WILL BE PERFORMED.
 THIS IS A GROUND STATE CALCULATION.
 THIS MOLECULE CONTAINS  2 ATOMS MADE UP FROM  2 DIFFERENT ELEMENTS.
 THIS MOLECULE CONTAINS  10 ATOMIC ORBITALS WITH A MAXIMUM OF  5 ON ANY ATOM.
 THE BASIS CONTAINS  10 STO'S WITH THE LARGEST ATOM HAVING  5 WITH (N,L) UP TO (2,1).
 THE MAXIMUM NUMBER CYCLES TO BE ALLOWED IS100 WITH 20 ITERATIONS PER CYCLE.
 THE MAXIMUM CPU TIME ALLOWED IS   200. SECONDS.
 THE TWO-ELECTRON INTEGRAL BUFFER IS  804 DOUBLE WORDS LONG.
 THE SMALLEST EXPONENT EVALUATED DURING INTEGRAL COMPUTATION IS  -60.0
 THE TOTAL ENERGY CONVERGENCE THRESHOLD IS  1.0D-04
 THE FERMI "TEMPERATURE" FOR CHARGE EQUILIBRATION IS  1.0D+06
 THE CHARGE TRANSFER IN THE MOLECULE WILL BE DAMPED BY  0.00 **  1.00.
 THE FOLLOWING CONDITIONS WILL BE SATISFIED ACCORDING TO
    THE GIVEN WEIGHTS IN FITTING THE MODEL POTENTIALS.
       BEHAVIOR AT THE NUCLEUS........   1.0000
       HF COUL POTENTIAL AT NUCLEUS...   1.0000
       CORE HF COULOMB POTENTIALS.....   1.0000
       VALENCE HF COULOMB POTENTIALS..   1.0000
       EXTERNAL NUC. ATT. POTENTIAL...   1.0000
 THE ENERGY DEPENDENCE OF THE PSEUDOPOTENTIAL WILL BE HANDLED BY PSEUDOMETRIC.
 THE CHANGE IN THE EXTERNAL POTENTIAL WILL BE DAMPED BY  0.50 **  1.00.
 THE P-K PROJECTION MATRIX WILL BE SCALED BY  0.80.
 THE PRIMITIVE TWO-CENTER OVERLAP INTEGRALS WILL BE ON DIRECT-ACCESS UNIT  1.
 THE PRIMITIVE TWO-CENTER MODEL POTENTIAL INTEGRALS WILL BE ON UNIT  2.
 THE INTERMEDIATE AND FINAL ATOMIC DATA WILL BE ON UNITS  3 AND  4 ALTERNATELY.
 THE FINAL CSF (MOLSTRUCT) OUTPUT WILL BE ON UNIT 10.
 THE 99-0 ORBITAL ON ATOM 99 WILL BE PUNCHED.
